{title: Northbound Train}
{artist: The Demo Band}
{key: E}
{tempo: 132}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro: E riff x4}

{start_of_verse}
[E]Ticket in my pocket and a [A]suitcase full of [E]rain
[E]Every mile a little lighter on the [B]northbound [E]train
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Roll on, roll [E]on
[A]steel wheels [B]singing a [E]song
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
